{"schemaVersion":1,"id":201,"sections":[{"id":"346002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20529],"start":0,"count":9},{"id":"346002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20530],"start":9,"count":13}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346002-PROLOGUE:20529:1","scriptId":20529,"text":"正在模拟战斗系统中进行测试的指挥官一行——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-PROLOGUE:20529:2","scriptId":20529,"text":"“这机械蛇也太大了吧，真的有那么大的战车兽吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-PROLOGUE:20529:3","scriptId":20529,"text":"“但根据波西娅所说，这种机械蛇也是有弱点的，只要我们找到弱点的话……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":743,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-PROLOGUE:20529:4","scriptId":20529,"text":"“这也大过头了啊！根本赢不了的啦……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":743,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346002-PROLOGUE:20529:5","scriptId":20529,"text":"这次的目标是要我们突破这像城墙一样巨大的机械蛇……用望远镜看过去这种怪物还不止一条。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":743,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-PROLOGUE:20529:6","scriptId":20529,"text":"“总觉得是数据出了问题……这大小也太离谱了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":743,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346002-PROLOGUE:20529:7","scriptId":20529,"text":"这时候天空中传来了波西娅的声音。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":743,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-PROLOGUE:20529:8","scriptId":20529,"text":"“不要怀疑数据，这就是实际存在的物种，你们快给我上！已经调低了痛觉系数，别怕。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":743,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346002-PROLOGUE:20529:9","scriptId":20529,"text":"没有办法，于是我们只得硬着头皮上了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":743,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:1","scriptId":20530,"text":"一番恶战之后，我们终于打开了一个缺口从几条巨蛇中间穿了过去，到达了目的地。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":743,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:2","scriptId":20530,"text":"“呼……真是危险，不过总算是解决掉了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:3","scriptId":20530,"text":"“这都是长官的功劳。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:4","scriptId":20530,"text":"“不过你怎么知道机械蛇的弱点是在那个部位？难道波西娅提前告诉你了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":747,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:5","scriptId":20530,"text":"“如果那样倒可以让我轻松不少，可惜波西娅并不是那样老好人啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":747,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:6","scriptId":20530,"text":"“小时候有过抓蛇的经验，我刚才要你们攻击的那个部分是蛇的心脏。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":747,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:7","scriptId":20530,"text":"“虽然是战车兽，但仍旧保持了动物时的生理结构，所以攻击那个部位，能让蛇感到恐惧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":747,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:8","scriptId":20530,"text":"“原来如此，所以在连续受到攻击之后那些蛇就退开了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:9","scriptId":20530,"text":"“是啊，装甲再怎么厚，只要弱点遭到连续攻击的话也会因为害怕进入防御模式，而蛇的防御就是盘起身体，所以自然就把道路让开了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:10","scriptId":20530,"text":"就在这时，我们的眼前突然变得一片漆黑，不过凭经验我们知道是波西娅关闭了模拟程序。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:13","scriptId":20530,"text":"“干得很好，看来你们已经能处理这种巨型猛兽了，接下来的正式任务中你们可能会遇上这种敌人～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:14","scriptId":20530,"text":"“什么！？正式任务？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346002-EPILOGUE:20530:15","scriptId":20530,"text":"“你这是什么表情啊，还不快感谢我？特意为你们打了个预防针。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
